00081E38                            
00081E38 =0007FD20                  MegaPCM_LoadDriver:	equ	MegaPCMLibraryBlob+$0
00081E38 =0007FD8A                  MegaPCM_LoadSampleTable:	equ	MegaPCMLibraryBlob+$6A
